<br/>
Apple recently sent out its own App Store notification advertising a Paramount+ subscription deal, but the App Store does offer an option to opt out. Open the App Store, tap on your profile picture in the top-right corner, tap on Notifications, and turn off Recommendations & Offers. However, it is not clear if Apple obtained explicit consent from users as its App Store guidelines require. Of course, the App Store is a preinstalled app, so it technically does not have to follow the rules that Apple sets for third-party App Store apps.<br/>
